WEBVTT

01:26.490 --> 01:29.750
[Glory]

01:30.550 --> 01:32.990
[Episode 32]

01:35.710 --> 01:37.950
Bao, don't go.

01:40.430 --> 01:41.430
I won't let you go.

01:43.000 --> 01:45.259
The fever has clearly clouded your mind.

01:45.479 --> 01:46.740
That silver-tongued,

01:47.120 --> 01:49.120
cold-hearted, and ruthless Lord Lu

01:49.229 --> 01:50.430
is now hesitant

01:50.430 --> 01:51.229
and rambling.

01:52.310 --> 01:53.280
That proves the Duke's Mansion

01:53.280 --> 01:54.400
is not a good place.

01:55.150 --> 01:56.310
I will leave one day,

01:56.789 --> 01:57.640
but not now.

01:58.380 --> 02:00.240
And I do not intend to leave alone.

02:00.280 --> 02:01.590
Drink some water first.

02:01.590 --> 02:02.990
Then have some porridge.

02:03.350 --> 02:04.210
We'll talk more

02:04.680 --> 02:06.280
once you're feeling better.

02:31.880 --> 02:33.210
I'm not going anywhere.

02:33.320 --> 02:35.180
I'll bring you a bowl of porridge.

03:10.360 --> 03:11.150
Eat slowly.

03:12.240 --> 03:13.500
When you're finished,

03:14.310 --> 03:15.520
tell me how you became

03:15.910 --> 03:17.370
the Duke of Yongguo's son.

03:19.400 --> 03:21.000
Don't hide anything from me.

03:21.120 --> 03:21.920
Just be honest

03:22.280 --> 03:23.630
about what happened.

03:24.400 --> 03:25.200
Do you hear me?

03:30.710 --> 03:31.640
My mother's name

03:32.670 --> 03:33.670
is Li Xiuniang.

03:35.150 --> 03:36.310
She was originally the Duke's

03:36.310 --> 03:37.980
first wife's dowry maid.

03:44.520 --> 03:45.680
You scared me!

03:46.540 --> 03:47.070
Look.

03:47.240 --> 03:48.970
Look, did I draw this part well?

03:49.400 --> 03:50.190
Is this me?

03:52.590 --> 03:53.590
It looks exactly like me.

03:53.590 --> 03:54.360
Right?

03:54.360 --> 03:54.870
I...

03:54.870 --> 03:55.960
Very good!

03:56.640 --> 03:57.840
How dare you!

03:58.150 --> 03:59.680
Xiuniang, look at him!

03:59.680 --> 04:00.840
-He's bullying me.
-Let me draw one for you.

04:00.840 --> 04:01.470
Xiuniang!

04:01.740 --> 04:03.240
When my mother was only five years old,

04:03.240 --> 04:04.440
Madam Han bought her.

04:04.750 --> 04:07.030
She grew up serving
as Madam Han's companion.

04:07.030 --> 04:08.760
Later, when Madam Han married,

04:09.120 --> 04:10.840
my mother went with her
to the new household.

04:10.840 --> 04:11.680
At first,

04:12.590 --> 04:14.520
the newlyweds were deeply in love.

04:14.520 --> 04:15.560
They were inseparable—

04:15.560 --> 04:16.240
like the most

04:16.240 --> 04:17.899
intimate couple in the world.

04:18.820 --> 04:19.380
Doctor.

04:19.399 --> 04:20.260
Your Highness.

04:21.120 --> 04:22.980
Is there truly no other way to solve this?

04:22.980 --> 04:24.980
I'm sorry. There's nothing I can do.

04:25.920 --> 04:27.160
Three years passed,

04:27.830 --> 04:29.960
yet Madam Han still hadn't conceived.

04:30.240 --> 04:31.000
And the Duke

04:31.000 --> 04:32.460
was his family's only son.

04:32.700 --> 04:34.580
He's a man bound for the battlefield.

04:34.580 --> 04:35.670
The gossip and criticism

04:35.670 --> 04:36.930
suffocated Madam Han.

04:37.390 --> 04:38.390
So she was forced to arrange

04:38.390 --> 04:39.870
two beautiful concubines for her husband.

04:39.870 --> 04:42.230
Eventually, even my mother

04:42.600 --> 04:44.310
was made the Duke's concubine.

04:44.310 --> 04:44.950
Later,

04:45.350 --> 04:47.390
my mother gave birth
to a son, as expected.

04:47.390 --> 04:48.510
From that day on,

04:48.970 --> 04:50.500
everything was different.

04:58.360 --> 04:59.310
Don't be afraid.

04:59.950 --> 05:00.880
Don't be afraid.

05:01.370 --> 05:01.890
Kneel!

05:08.470 --> 05:09.230
Miss!

05:09.660 --> 05:11.590
I've been serving you

05:11.610 --> 05:12.950
since I was six years old.

05:12.950 --> 05:13.830
In this world,

05:13.830 --> 05:15.680
I'm the only one
who would never lie to you

05:15.680 --> 05:17.190
or betray you!

05:17.190 --> 05:18.310
Miss!

05:18.690 --> 05:20.090
You're wrong, Xiuniang.

05:20.680 --> 05:21.610
You did lie to me.

05:22.760 --> 05:24.690
And you betrayed me a long time ago.

05:25.260 --> 05:25.830
Miss!

05:27.070 --> 05:28.070
Miss!

05:28.310 --> 05:30.040
-Don't move.
-Miss!

05:30.390 --> 05:31.800
Miss!

05:52.480 --> 05:53.610
What happened next?

05:53.909 --> 05:56.110
Madam Han was consumed by her jealousy.

05:56.920 --> 05:59.750
Any concubine
who got slightly close to the Duke

06:00.510 --> 06:01.970
would be treated harshly.

06:02.570 --> 06:03.630
My mother realized

06:04.870 --> 06:05.510
that the young lady

06:05.510 --> 06:08.040
who once rescued her
from a crowd of refugees,

06:08.390 --> 06:10.480
giving her porridge and medicine,

06:10.480 --> 06:12.680
saving her life—
was no longer the same.

06:13.270 --> 06:16.000
She had become someone pitiful,
and terrifying.

06:16.850 --> 06:18.490
To escape her clutches,

06:19.830 --> 06:22.070
she only had one choice:

06:22.750 --> 06:23.800
to flee far away

06:23.800 --> 06:25.040
and never return.

06:25.680 --> 06:26.430
So,

06:27.240 --> 06:29.640
while the Duke was away
on the battlefield,

06:30.300 --> 06:32.700
and Madam Han
was visiting her family home,

06:33.140 --> 06:35.340
she seized the chance to flee in secret.

06:36.190 --> 06:38.120
She begged all the way to the South.

07:25.380 --> 07:27.240
Yuan, quickly. Go and take a look.

07:39.670 --> 07:41.670
My father was a kind and upright man.

07:42.970 --> 07:44.370
He saved my mother's life

07:45.470 --> 07:48.000
and gathered enough money
for her journey home.

07:48.000 --> 07:49.860
But when Mother reached the ferry

07:50.790 --> 07:51.760
and found

07:52.480 --> 07:54.810
twenty strings of copper coins in her bag,

07:56.390 --> 07:57.320
she turned back.

07:59.000 --> 08:00.680
Father raised me as his own.

08:01.390 --> 08:04.250
He lived frugally,
all for the sake of my education.

08:05.340 --> 08:06.710
I never once thought

08:07.400 --> 08:08.190
that I might not be

08:08.190 --> 08:09.320
his biological son.

08:10.510 --> 08:12.510
Until my mother was on her deathbed,

08:12.900 --> 08:14.560
she finally told me the truth.

08:16.390 --> 08:17.190
She was afraid

08:18.720 --> 08:21.180
that one day,
people from the Duke's Mansion

08:21.620 --> 08:23.220
might come searching for us.

08:23.830 --> 08:25.870
When your mother
escaped from Duke's Mansion,

08:25.870 --> 08:27.200
she was still pregnant.

08:27.940 --> 08:30.790
Then the child she left behind
in the mansion...

08:33.600 --> 08:34.390
I don't know.

08:35.370 --> 08:36.770
The Duke only has one son,

08:37.270 --> 08:38.610
and in the Duke of Yongguo's Mansion,

08:38.610 --> 08:40.480
there's only one legitimate heir.

08:40.480 --> 08:42.809
Everyone was told,
he was Madam Han's son.

08:43.080 --> 08:44.169
Everyone believes

08:44.660 --> 08:46.670
she is the child's biological mother.

08:46.670 --> 08:47.670
He legitimately

08:47.670 --> 08:49.720
holds the position of the Duke's heir.

08:49.720 --> 08:50.320
Jianglai,

08:51.410 --> 08:52.170
you have

08:52.650 --> 08:54.600
a full brother, your own flesh and blood.

08:54.600 --> 08:56.730
What does blood relation even matter?

08:57.270 --> 08:59.600
My adoptive father's kindness
is as deep as the sea.

08:59.600 --> 09:02.270
Even if I were crushed to pieces,
I could never repay what he gave me.

09:02.270 --> 09:03.200
My surname is Lu,

09:03.200 --> 09:04.530
and it will always be Lu.

09:05.480 --> 09:06.630
I will never acknowledge anyone else

09:06.630 --> 09:07.510
as my father—

09:08.240 --> 09:09.390
whether he's a duke

09:10.270 --> 09:11.200
or an emperor.

09:15.080 --> 09:16.080
Are you also trying to persuade me

09:16.080 --> 09:17.740
to return to my ancestral root

09:18.150 --> 09:19.360
and call him Father?

09:22.480 --> 09:24.410
You are your own person, and so am I.

09:25.270 --> 09:25.960
Why would I impose

09:25.960 --> 09:27.600
my will upon you?

09:28.810 --> 09:30.050
Does that mean in the future,

09:30.050 --> 09:31.920
you would also force others
into difficult positions,

09:31.920 --> 09:32.460
and compel me to do

09:32.460 --> 09:33.990
things I'm unwilling to do?

09:42.900 --> 09:44.830
Then why exactly did you come here?

09:45.120 --> 09:46.980
Could it be that you care about me,

09:47.790 --> 09:49.620
and you came specifically for me?

09:49.620 --> 09:51.150
Who said I came here for you?

09:52.060 --> 09:53.860
I'm simply returning the favor.

09:54.130 --> 09:56.100
The Duke of Yongguo's family
has used every scheme imaginable.

09:56.100 --> 09:57.990
So I might as well step into his territory

09:57.990 --> 09:59.320
and turn it upside down—

10:00.170 --> 10:01.250
just to show him

10:01.580 --> 10:04.110
that the Rong family
is not to be trifled with.

10:04.840 --> 10:05.510
This place is not

10:05.510 --> 10:07.670
your Jiangnan Rong family's territory.

10:07.670 --> 10:10.070
He has the royal favor and great power.

10:10.750 --> 10:11.790
He has prestige at court,

10:11.790 --> 10:13.270
and personal guards in his mansion.

10:13.270 --> 10:15.150
Even if Old Madam Rong herself were here,

10:15.150 --> 10:17.320
she would have to show him some respect.

10:17.320 --> 10:19.440
Now he's using his seniority

10:19.770 --> 10:22.240
to openly pressure others
with filial piety and righteousness.

10:22.240 --> 10:25.280
If you go against him,
you're being disrespectful to the elders.

10:25.280 --> 10:28.080
If you don't comply with him,
you're defying moral principles.

10:28.080 --> 10:29.030
You'd be making an enemy

10:29.030 --> 10:30.030
of the loyal hero,

10:30.750 --> 10:32.880
and the whole world would condemn you.

10:33.670 --> 10:34.400
Take it easy.

10:35.290 --> 10:37.360
One must have a plan before taking action.

10:37.360 --> 10:38.420
Let's wait and see.

10:43.390 --> 10:44.240
Then tell me.

10:45.390 --> 10:46.050
Should I...

10:49.200 --> 10:50.240
pay him a visit?

11:46.860 --> 11:48.270
Has Master Jianglai eaten?

11:48.270 --> 11:48.930
Yes, he has.

11:49.120 --> 11:50.000
Really?

11:51.720 --> 11:54.030
His Highness's plan was truly brilliant.

11:54.030 --> 11:55.690
By keeping Lady Shanbao here,

11:55.720 --> 11:58.250
Master Jianglai
will naturally stay as well.

12:00.670 --> 12:01.720
Last night,

12:02.420 --> 12:05.020
did Lady Shanbao
actually stay inside to rest?

12:15.870 --> 12:18.080
Master Jianglai,
do you have any instructions?

12:18.080 --> 12:19.410
I had a fever last night.

12:19.550 --> 12:21.630
Lady Shanbao stayed specifically
to take care of me.

12:21.630 --> 12:23.120
She has just laid down to rest.

12:23.120 --> 12:25.850
If she wakes up
and asks about accommodations...

12:25.880 --> 12:27.670
Everything has already been arranged.

12:27.670 --> 12:28.720
Only Lady Shanbao

12:29.030 --> 12:30.440
can put your mind at ease.

12:30.840 --> 12:32.790
Naturally, wherever you are,

12:33.080 --> 12:35.480
Lady Shanbao will be accommodated nearby.

12:36.000 --> 12:37.150
I will have them immediately

12:37.150 --> 12:38.390
prepare the side room

12:38.510 --> 12:39.440
next to the study.

12:39.440 --> 12:39.960
No.

12:41.030 --> 12:42.550
Leave the study for Shanbao.

12:42.550 --> 12:44.010
I'll stay in the side room.

12:46.200 --> 12:46.750
Also,

12:47.550 --> 12:48.870
release my personal servant,

12:48.870 --> 12:49.440
Jun Dai.

12:50.000 --> 12:52.080
I'm not used to being served by others.

12:52.080 --> 12:53.270
As long as you've come to your senses,

12:53.270 --> 12:54.960
whatever you say goes.

12:55.120 --> 12:56.850
I'll have him released at once.

12:58.660 --> 12:59.520
One last thing.

13:00.320 --> 13:01.000
I want...

13:05.080 --> 13:06.610
to pay Master Shuyu a visit.

13:07.440 --> 13:09.510
That... is beyond my ability.

13:09.510 --> 13:10.370
Then go and ask.

13:11.350 --> 13:13.030
Ask the person who is actually in charge.

13:13.030 --> 13:14.440
Yes, Master Jianglai.

13:14.790 --> 13:15.850
I'll go right away.

13:25.240 --> 13:26.240
This way, please.

13:26.850 --> 13:27.420
This way.

13:36.250 --> 13:38.770
Why is this courtyard so secluded?

13:38.900 --> 13:40.870
Master Jianglai, you've just returned.

13:40.870 --> 13:42.650
You don't know Master Shuyu's temperament.

13:42.650 --> 13:44.150
He values peace above all else.

13:44.150 --> 13:45.440
Ever since he fell from a horse that year,

13:45.440 --> 13:47.080
his leg injury
flares up badly each winter.

13:47.080 --> 13:48.480
He rarely steps outside,

13:48.590 --> 13:50.270
and he dislikes being disturbed
by outsiders even more.

13:50.270 --> 13:51.730
Living here is the only way

13:51.950 --> 13:53.350
he can recover in peace.

14:07.120 --> 14:08.320
Fuping.

14:08.410 --> 14:10.400
[Fuping Pavilion]

14:09.550 --> 14:11.030
How can the Duke's heir

14:11.790 --> 14:13.200
live in such isolation?

14:13.510 --> 14:14.510
Master Jianglai.

14:15.480 --> 14:16.480
Master Jianglai.

14:17.600 --> 14:18.150
This way.

14:37.880 --> 14:40.660
[Xue Shuyu, the Duke of Yongguo's heir]

14:49.670 --> 14:51.000
I've always been frail.

14:51.510 --> 14:53.440
My stomach can't tolerate cold food.

14:53.440 --> 14:54.270
Usually,

14:54.390 --> 14:56.520
Fuping Pavilion rarely has visitors,

14:56.720 --> 14:58.780
so we haven't prepared any green tea.

14:58.790 --> 15:01.120
I hope this Pu'er suits your tatse?

15:01.910 --> 15:02.600
Yes.

15:06.510 --> 15:09.320
Pu'er is fine too.

15:29.870 --> 15:30.870
You may leave now.

15:31.720 --> 15:32.700
Master Jianglai,

15:32.700 --> 15:33.900
by the Duke's orders,

15:34.120 --> 15:35.910
I must stay by your side

15:36.150 --> 15:37.910
to serve you.

15:38.480 --> 15:39.630
I'm just having a few words

15:39.630 --> 15:40.690
with Master Shuyu.

15:41.080 --> 15:43.740
It's not as if I can grow wings
and fly away, is it?

15:44.030 --> 15:44.720
Get out!

15:49.840 --> 15:50.440
Let me see.

15:51.190 --> 15:52.520
It's nothing. I'm fine.

15:52.760 --> 15:54.290
It was my own carelessness.

15:54.550 --> 15:55.530
Master Shuyu is hurt.

15:55.530 --> 15:57.260
Hurry and fetch some medicine!

16:03.120 --> 16:04.390
I told you to get out!

16:05.770 --> 16:06.500
Understood.

16:07.000 --> 16:07.730
Understood.

16:22.750 --> 16:23.550
It's alright.

16:55.390 --> 16:56.150
Actually...

16:59.750 --> 17:01.280
actually, I came here today

17:02.780 --> 17:04.240
because I wanted to ask...

17:08.589 --> 17:09.589
if you knew

17:10.790 --> 17:12.630
that we...

17:16.040 --> 17:16.839
Master Shuyu.

17:20.440 --> 17:21.240
Master Shuyu.

17:21.910 --> 17:22.500
Brother!

17:36.930 --> 17:38.200
Master Shuyu,
hurry and take your medicine.

17:38.200 --> 17:40.200
You'll feel better after taking it.

18:06.920 --> 18:07.720
It's my fault.

18:08.310 --> 18:09.830
I have disrupted Master Shuyu's rest.

18:09.830 --> 18:11.090
I'll take my leave now.

18:11.310 --> 18:12.520
I'll come to visit you another day.

18:12.520 --> 18:13.480
Master Shuyu,

18:15.200 --> 18:17.130
please take good care of yourself.

18:18.270 --> 18:19.470
I've been a poor host.

18:20.310 --> 18:21.240
Let's meet again

18:23.400 --> 18:24.300
another time.

19:00.460 --> 19:01.460
Master Jianglai.

19:06.640 --> 19:08.860
[Master Shuyu's concubine, Ji Ping]

19:39.400 --> 19:40.600
Call that woman here.

19:42.380 --> 19:43.840
Get her here immediately!

19:46.200 --> 19:48.860
When you know where to stop,
you have stability.

19:49.070 --> 19:51.600
When you have stability,
you can be tranquil.

19:51.830 --> 19:54.090
When you are tranquil, you can be at ease.

19:55.110 --> 19:57.830
When you are at ease,
you can deliberate.

19:58.200 --> 20:01.000
When you can deliberate,
you can attain your aims.

20:01.160 --> 20:04.270
Things have their roots and branches,
affairs have their ends and beginnings.

20:04.270 --> 20:04.880
What is it?

20:04.880 --> 20:05.680
Madam Xie.

20:06.270 --> 20:07.930
Master Shuyu wants to see you.

20:14.860 --> 20:16.950
It's alright. Continue your studies.

20:16.950 --> 20:18.010
I will be back soon.

20:18.310 --> 20:18.770
Be good.

20:20.000 --> 20:20.810
Keep writing.

20:31.260 --> 20:32.770
[Virtue]

21:15.550 --> 21:16.240
Madam Xie!

21:19.360 --> 21:20.490
Enough with the act!

21:20.790 --> 21:22.200
You heartless woman.

21:22.750 --> 21:24.430
You knew perfectly well
that he brought that illegitimate son back

21:24.430 --> 21:25.690
in order to replace me.

21:25.840 --> 21:27.570
And yet, you still helped him
scheme against me!

21:27.570 --> 21:28.680
I'm your husband.

21:30.190 --> 21:31.250
But what about you?

21:32.090 --> 21:33.290
You're just like him.

21:34.200 --> 21:36.350
You despise me; you loathe me.

21:37.400 --> 21:38.920
Everyone wants me dead!

21:45.680 --> 21:46.730
Once I'm dead,

21:47.200 --> 21:48.510
the title of the Duke's heir

21:48.510 --> 21:50.510
will pass to that illegitimate son.

21:50.670 --> 21:52.270
Then he'll get what he wants.

21:52.880 --> 21:53.510
And you...

21:54.840 --> 21:55.540
And you!

21:57.310 --> 21:59.310
Master Shuyu, your hand is injured.

21:59.750 --> 22:00.720
I would never help an outsider

22:00.720 --> 22:01.510
to harm you.

22:01.790 --> 22:03.180
I am your wife!

22:04.220 --> 22:05.030
Really?

22:07.400 --> 22:08.930
You may fool everyone else,

22:09.640 --> 22:10.900
but you cannot fool me!

22:11.030 --> 22:12.550
You're a heartless woman.

22:13.570 --> 22:14.640
You've never once respected

22:14.640 --> 22:15.640
your own husband.

22:16.340 --> 22:17.400
You look down on me.

22:18.350 --> 22:19.000
Deep down,

22:19.000 --> 22:20.460
you curse me day and night,

22:21.200 --> 22:22.770
wishing I'd die sooner!

22:22.800 --> 22:24.410
I never wanted you to die.

22:24.440 --> 22:25.640
I've always wanted what's best for you.

22:25.640 --> 22:27.060
I've always been protecting you!

22:27.060 --> 22:28.920
Master Shuyu, please believe me.

22:29.000 --> 22:30.110
I really didn't...

22:32.460 --> 22:32.940
No!

22:35.440 --> 22:36.200
Madam Xie!

22:40.830 --> 22:42.030
Father is bullying Mother!

22:42.030 --> 22:43.230
Father is a bad man!

22:43.710 --> 22:44.750
I hate you.

22:44.820 --> 22:46.380
I hate you!

22:57.920 --> 23:00.530
I... I didn't mean to.

23:01.340 --> 23:02.800
She suddenly lunged at me.

23:03.020 --> 23:04.680
I just wanted to push her away.

23:04.690 --> 23:05.210
I...

23:07.270 --> 23:07.830
I...

23:09.680 --> 23:10.440
What kind of child

23:10.440 --> 23:12.000
would dare bite her own father?

23:12.000 --> 23:13.960
Defying one's parents
is a sin against Heaven.

23:13.960 --> 23:15.070
I wonder how Mrs. Xue

23:15.070 --> 23:16.750
usually disciplines her children,

23:16.750 --> 23:17.480
to raise Miss Sun

23:17.480 --> 23:18.880
to be so willful and rude.

23:19.350 --> 23:21.160
If this ever reaches the Duchess's ears,

23:21.160 --> 23:22.690
you will surely be whipped.

23:22.790 --> 23:23.400
Mrs. Xue,

23:23.400 --> 23:24.460
quickly take your daughter away,

23:24.460 --> 23:26.120
and discipline her properly.

23:29.510 --> 23:30.000
Leave.

23:31.350 --> 23:32.350
All of you, leave!

23:36.960 --> 23:38.750
Master Shuyu, please don't be angry.

23:38.750 --> 23:41.140
I'll keep you company,
and we can drink and relax.

23:41.140 --> 23:42.620
Let's invite Die, Chuan,

23:42.650 --> 23:43.980
and Qinfang as well.

23:45.110 --> 23:46.030
We can secretly

23:46.030 --> 23:47.340
bring in an opera troupe

23:47.340 --> 23:48.200
to have some fun

23:48.480 --> 23:49.940
and drive away this gloom.

24:01.930 --> 24:04.410
Lian Xin, don't cry.

24:05.500 --> 24:07.230
Xuanyu has just fallen asleep.

24:08.070 --> 24:09.070
Don't wake her up.

24:10.070 --> 24:10.900
Madam Xie.

24:11.830 --> 24:13.490
Master Shuyu has gone too far,

24:13.930 --> 24:15.930
letting that woman poison his mind,

24:16.510 --> 24:18.830
and losing his temper
with you every single time.

24:18.830 --> 24:20.250
You've suffered so much.

24:21.310 --> 24:24.440
Master Shuyu has fallen out of favor
with the Duke.

24:26.120 --> 24:28.180
His situation is already difficult.

24:29.300 --> 24:30.830
I don't want to make a scene,

24:31.470 --> 24:34.110
because I don't want
to bring him any more trouble.

24:34.110 --> 24:35.310
But your arm...

24:36.480 --> 24:37.680
What should we do?

24:38.640 --> 24:39.970
Give me a piece of gauze.

24:54.420 --> 24:55.350
How could you...

25:02.400 --> 25:03.000
My...

25:04.370 --> 25:08.080
My grandfather was once the
President of the Imperial Medical Bureau.

25:08.080 --> 25:09.940
I do have some medical knowledge.

25:10.670 --> 25:13.510
It's just that I rarely
have occasion to use it.

25:14.590 --> 25:17.450
Madam Xie, there's a message
from Fuping Pavilion.

25:18.060 --> 25:18.670
Come in.

25:21.230 --> 25:24.380
Madam Xie, Master Shuyu says...

25:25.550 --> 25:26.160
Go ahead.

25:27.350 --> 25:28.480
Master Shuyu says,

25:28.560 --> 25:30.290
Miss Ji Ping wants to dress
as a titled lady,

25:30.290 --> 25:32.140
so... she would like to borrow

25:32.160 --> 25:34.620
your phoenix coronet and ceremonial robes.

25:35.720 --> 25:36.550
How dare she wear

25:36.550 --> 25:37.880
a titled lady's attire?

25:37.960 --> 25:39.620
Is she trying to kill herself?

25:41.350 --> 25:42.280
Give them to her.

26:19.750 --> 26:20.600
Madam Xie.

26:23.520 --> 26:24.180
Lian Xin...

26:26.960 --> 26:27.640
Do I

26:27.640 --> 26:28.830
look dreadful?

26:31.650 --> 26:33.110
Help me touch up my makeup.

26:33.860 --> 26:35.410
You are injured so badly.

26:36.070 --> 26:37.270
Where are you going?

26:39.850 --> 26:43.050
Madam Chang is hosting
a guest from the Rong family today.

26:43.270 --> 26:44.400
I must be there.

26:51.830 --> 26:52.680
Don't worry.

26:54.310 --> 26:55.180
I won't die.

26:56.980 --> 26:58.260
Apply the rouge

26:58.960 --> 27:00.290
a little heavier for me.

27:02.030 --> 27:03.230
And wipe the blood

27:04.070 --> 27:05.070
from my forehead.

27:50.030 --> 27:50.790
Xiu Qiong.

27:52.270 --> 27:54.130
Take a look at the Duke's Mansion.

27:54.550 --> 27:56.680
How does it compare to our own mansion?

27:59.350 --> 28:00.550
In my humble opinion,

28:00.680 --> 28:02.590
the pavilion is grand enough,

28:03.350 --> 28:04.680
but it feels lifeless.

28:05.750 --> 28:07.550
At the Rong Mansion, Old Madam Rong's
presence is overwhelming;

28:07.550 --> 28:08.160
when she gets angry,

28:08.160 --> 28:09.720
everyone trembles with fear.

28:09.720 --> 28:11.400
Yet even then, the maids in her courtyard

28:11.400 --> 28:13.110
still laugh and chatter.

28:13.790 --> 28:15.390
But this place is different.

28:15.590 --> 28:18.020
There are people
in every pavilion and corridor,

28:18.020 --> 28:19.310
yet all of them either look dejected

28:19.310 --> 28:20.440
or expressionless.

28:21.000 --> 28:22.750
They don't even dare
to take a deep breath.

28:22.750 --> 28:23.750
It's as if

28:23.750 --> 28:25.030
you've stepped into a temple

28:25.030 --> 28:26.310
and found everyone turned to stone.

28:26.310 --> 28:27.510
It's so frightening.

28:54.680 --> 28:55.880
Lady Shanbao is here.

28:58.740 --> 29:00.470
Madam Chang is waiting for you.

29:01.280 --> 29:03.080
I was passing through the garden

29:03.110 --> 29:04.070
and a Pekingese

29:04.070 --> 29:05.270
accidentally lunged at me.

29:05.270 --> 29:06.750
My hem got a bit dirty.

29:07.110 --> 29:09.110
I'm afraid it might displease Madam Chang.

29:09.110 --> 29:10.640
Allow me to change my outfit

29:10.640 --> 29:11.780
before I pay my formal respects.

29:11.780 --> 29:13.400
Please forgive my bluntness.

29:13.400 --> 29:14.030
Madam Chang

29:14.030 --> 29:15.270
has been waiting for quite a long time.

29:15.270 --> 29:16.640
And her patience is wearing thin.

29:16.640 --> 29:18.100
You should go in together.

29:22.510 --> 29:23.310
Lady Shanbao,

29:24.400 --> 29:25.400
this way, please.

29:25.510 --> 29:26.640
After you, Mrs. Xue.

29:34.110 --> 29:35.710
Such a well-composed child—

29:36.720 --> 29:38.920
good-looking, with an elegant manner.

29:39.680 --> 29:41.550
No wonder His Highness likes you.

29:41.870 --> 29:44.400
I'm quite pleased as well.

29:49.380 --> 29:51.290
But you entered first instead of

29:51.310 --> 29:52.770
letting the guest walk in.

29:53.160 --> 29:54.440
Where are your manners?

29:54.440 --> 29:55.550
How disgraceful.

29:57.420 --> 29:58.680
It was my fault.

30:00.350 --> 30:02.070
You young people

30:02.440 --> 30:04.640
are always so careless with etiquette.

30:04.640 --> 30:06.750
Since she is a distinguished guest
of the Duke's Mansion,

30:06.750 --> 30:09.480
you should've shown greater courtesy.

30:09.740 --> 30:11.540
How could you just walk in first?

30:12.480 --> 30:13.210
Madam Chang,

30:14.150 --> 30:15.930
Mrs. Xue holds an imperial title

30:15.930 --> 30:17.010
and is my senior.

30:17.310 --> 30:18.310
As a guest,

30:18.950 --> 30:20.710
there was no reason for Mrs. Xue

30:20.740 --> 30:21.810
to yield to me.

30:26.880 --> 30:27.830
Earlier,

30:28.270 --> 30:30.640
I heard you refused
to ride the sedan chair.

30:30.640 --> 30:31.720
I thought

30:32.030 --> 30:33.400
you were a willful girl.

30:34.110 --> 30:36.000
But seeing how you speak and act now,

30:36.000 --> 30:38.270
you appear well-educated and proper.

30:39.400 --> 30:40.830
So why

30:40.830 --> 30:42.070
were you so defiant

30:42.070 --> 30:43.600
toward your elders before?

30:44.830 --> 30:47.350
Do you know that since ancient times,

30:47.350 --> 30:48.640
marriage has required

30:48.750 --> 30:50.350
the Six Rites?

30:50.680 --> 30:52.590
Even birth dates

30:52.680 --> 30:54.830
must be examined for compatibility

30:54.830 --> 30:57.030
to see if the union is blessed or cursed.

30:57.510 --> 31:00.070
You come
from a wealthy family in Jiangnan,

31:00.350 --> 31:01.330
which means

31:01.510 --> 31:03.590
you're a daughter
of a respectable household.

31:03.590 --> 31:05.790
You got engaged in secret

31:06.350 --> 31:07.750
without His Highness's permission.

31:07.750 --> 31:09.100
But since the Master Jianglai

31:09.100 --> 31:10.430
was alone away from home

31:10.440 --> 31:12.030
and had not yet returned to the family,

31:12.030 --> 31:14.440
I can overlook the haste of the ceremony

31:14.870 --> 31:16.470
and won't blame you for that.

31:17.030 --> 31:19.630
Do you know that
inviting you into this mansion

31:19.680 --> 31:20.350
means His Highness

31:20.350 --> 31:22.340
has accepted you as his daughter-in-law?

31:22.340 --> 31:23.070
Personally,

31:25.120 --> 31:26.450
I'm not pleased by this.

31:27.030 --> 31:27.960
But I will not

31:27.960 --> 31:29.290
oppose the Duke's will.

31:30.030 --> 31:31.480
In the future,

31:32.110 --> 31:33.590
I'll have to take extra care

31:33.590 --> 31:35.320
to teach you proper etiquette.

31:36.160 --> 31:37.000
Nanny Lian.

31:39.680 --> 31:41.360
Mrs. Xue allowed you to enter first

31:41.360 --> 31:42.710
out of kindness.

31:43.200 --> 31:43.880
But wearing

31:43.880 --> 31:45.770
the same color as Mrs. Xue

31:46.550 --> 31:48.410
is a serious breach of etiquette.

31:49.020 --> 31:50.540
Earlier, when you met her,

31:51.070 --> 31:52.640
you should've apologized

31:52.830 --> 31:55.230
and returned
to change your outfit at once.

31:55.820 --> 31:57.570
The Duke, favored by His Majesty,

31:57.570 --> 31:58.830
has long held a high position.

31:58.830 --> 32:00.830
Women of the inner household like us

32:01.040 --> 32:02.580
must show respect and obedience

32:02.580 --> 32:04.240
to our parents-in-law and husbands.

32:04.240 --> 32:06.270
Toward our servants, we must keep
a balance between kindness and discipline.

32:06.270 --> 32:09.880
We should reflect on ourselves constantly
and cultivate virtue and good fortune.

32:09.880 --> 32:12.720
We must stay vigilant in times of peace,
then we may begin and end with propriety.

32:12.720 --> 32:13.380
From now on,

32:14.670 --> 32:16.750
let the servants handle

32:16.830 --> 32:18.440
your public business.

32:18.720 --> 32:20.720
You should no longer
run about for your career.

32:20.720 --> 32:22.590
Such behavior is unseemly

32:22.590 --> 32:23.720
for a lady.

32:24.070 --> 32:26.270
It will only invite gossip and slander.

32:26.920 --> 32:27.830
From now on,

32:28.030 --> 32:29.630
you must be even more mindful

32:29.830 --> 32:31.290
of your words and actions.

32:31.590 --> 32:32.790
If you have any questions,

32:32.790 --> 32:34.590
you may consult Nanny Wan.

32:37.270 --> 32:38.350
Mrs. Xue

32:38.590 --> 32:40.400
serves the Duke and Duchess

32:40.480 --> 32:41.880
with the utmost respect.

32:42.830 --> 32:46.100
She pays her respects every day,
never missing a single day.

32:46.100 --> 32:48.490
Through all seasons, she never slackens.

32:49.070 --> 32:51.800
This is how a lady of a noble family
should behave.

32:52.240 --> 32:54.360
Unlike you, Lady Shanbao,

32:54.380 --> 32:57.480
who still requires
constant reminders from Madam Chang.

32:57.480 --> 32:58.710
If word were to get out,

32:58.710 --> 33:00.470
people would make fun of us.

33:01.270 --> 33:03.000
Jianglai had a high fever last night.

33:03.000 --> 33:04.350
Shanbao was taking care of him,

33:04.350 --> 33:05.780
which is why she arrived late today.

33:05.780 --> 33:07.580
Please don't blame her, Mother.

33:08.000 --> 33:09.600
Madam Chang is a kind person.

33:09.720 --> 33:12.000
She never criticizes
the younger generation harshly.

33:12.000 --> 33:13.150
As elders,

33:13.180 --> 33:14.960
the more tolerant and gentle they are,

33:14.960 --> 33:16.000
the more thoughtful and considerate

33:16.000 --> 33:17.920
the juniors must be,

33:18.480 --> 33:20.740
so you shouldn't be so careless anymore.

33:30.760 --> 33:32.720
Didn't your grandmother teach you

33:33.310 --> 33:34.750
to listen attentively

33:34.750 --> 33:36.210
when an elder is speaking?

33:36.240 --> 33:37.240
What's so funny?

33:39.200 --> 33:39.930
Madam Chang.

33:40.860 --> 33:41.620
Lord Lu and I

33:41.650 --> 33:43.200
aren't officially married yet.

33:43.200 --> 33:44.480
And even after we get married,

33:44.480 --> 33:46.110
he will marry into my Rong family,

33:46.110 --> 33:47.770
not me joining his Xue family.

33:48.030 --> 33:49.080
So your rules

33:49.480 --> 33:50.880
don't really apply to me.

33:55.880 --> 33:56.710
Master Jianglai

33:56.710 --> 33:58.750
is the biological son
of the Duke of Yongguo.

33:58.750 --> 34:00.350
He was born into nobility.

34:00.470 --> 34:01.600
And in the future...

34:02.790 --> 34:04.450
he's destined for greatness.

34:05.240 --> 34:07.060
How could he possibly
marry into your family?

34:07.060 --> 34:08.540
Since you're a couple,

34:08.710 --> 34:11.400
you should follow the rules
of the Duke's Mansion.

34:11.400 --> 34:13.800
In the Rong family,
the women run the house.

34:14.139 --> 34:14.980
And my sisters

34:15.139 --> 34:17.280
have their own businesses to attend to.

34:17.280 --> 34:18.480
If I were to marry out,

34:19.030 --> 34:20.860
who would manage the tea plantation?

34:20.860 --> 34:22.860
How would our family line continue?

34:23.239 --> 34:23.969
Therefore,

34:24.360 --> 34:26.510
it is only natural
that he marry into my family.

34:26.510 --> 34:27.280
Nonsense!

34:28.230 --> 34:30.000
The Rong family's matrilocal marriages

34:30.000 --> 34:31.860
are quite different from others.

34:49.980 --> 34:52.800
Mother, you may not know.

34:53.150 --> 34:55.949
Although Rong family's women
do take in husbands,

34:56.070 --> 34:57.960
they pick their men

34:58.760 --> 35:00.820
as if they're choosing merchandise.

35:01.320 --> 35:04.150
They love making men compete
in literary tests and martial contests,

35:04.150 --> 35:07.590
causing a huge scene throughout Jiangnan.

35:08.360 --> 35:10.690
They are pickier in choosing a son-in-law

35:10.800 --> 35:11.550
than His Majesty is

35:11.550 --> 35:14.000
in selecting scholars
through the imperial exams.

35:14.000 --> 35:15.070
Even if

35:15.100 --> 35:16.630
they manage to get married,

35:17.030 --> 35:19.360
they treat divorce as something trivial.

35:19.510 --> 35:22.710
They're fickle and unfaithful,

35:23.670 --> 35:26.000
completely lacking all womanly virtues.

35:27.630 --> 35:28.290
Yingchuan,

35:28.630 --> 35:30.000
Lady Shanbao is a distinguished guest

35:30.000 --> 35:30.950
of the Duke's Mansion.

35:30.950 --> 35:32.410
Don't be so rude like that.

35:32.590 --> 35:33.440
Besides,

35:33.590 --> 35:35.150
every place has its own customs.

35:35.150 --> 35:36.670
Judging others so lightly

35:37.000 --> 35:38.510
is not how we treat guests.

35:40.390 --> 35:41.230
Lady Shanbao,

35:41.630 --> 35:43.280
this is the Duke's beloved daughter.

35:43.280 --> 35:44.570
The Empress Dowager granted her

35:44.570 --> 35:46.370
the title of Princess Jinxiang.

35:48.840 --> 35:50.030
I see.

35:52.320 --> 35:53.360
Lady Shanbao.

35:54.400 --> 35:56.960
Since ancient times,
a loyal official serves one lord,

35:56.960 --> 35:58.920
and a fine horse bears only one saddle.

35:58.920 --> 36:00.320
If a husband goes astray,

36:00.440 --> 36:02.760
a proper wife
should guide him back on track,

36:02.760 --> 36:05.800
and influence him with her own virtue.

36:07.030 --> 36:09.230
How can you speak of divorce so lightly?

36:09.470 --> 36:10.990
A woman who remarries

36:11.230 --> 36:12.920
ruins both her own fortune

36:12.920 --> 36:14.580
and her family's reputation.

36:14.710 --> 36:16.320
It is a man's nature

36:16.550 --> 36:18.280
to crave someone new.

36:18.800 --> 36:19.710
Now,

36:20.070 --> 36:21.550
since you're young and beautiful,

36:21.550 --> 36:23.150
he may still tolerate you.

36:23.710 --> 36:25.590
But when your beauty fades,

36:25.920 --> 36:27.380
and affection grows thin,

36:27.960 --> 36:29.630
forget about growing old together

36:29.630 --> 36:30.710
in harmony—

36:31.800 --> 36:33.920
even sharing a simple meal

36:34.880 --> 36:36.590
will become unbearable.

36:46.150 --> 36:48.190
I've said every kind word as possible,

36:48.190 --> 36:49.520
yet you remain unmoved.

36:50.030 --> 36:52.160
You're truly stubborn beyond reason!

36:52.190 --> 36:52.800
Mother,

36:53.280 --> 36:54.710
for such a shameless woman,

36:54.710 --> 36:56.070
even the seat she touched

36:56.070 --> 36:57.710
should be scrubbed ten times over

36:57.710 --> 36:59.440
to cleanse the air of her filth.

36:59.440 --> 37:00.360
Since she turns a deaf ear to my advice

37:00.360 --> 37:01.560
and shows no remorse,

37:01.840 --> 37:03.440
we should drive her out at once,

37:03.440 --> 37:05.630
before she pollutes your Hanyu Courtyard.

37:05.630 --> 37:06.550
Yingchuan.

37:07.190 --> 37:09.070
When will you ever learn

37:09.070 --> 37:10.670
to control your impulsive manner?

37:10.670 --> 37:11.920
For a young lady,

37:12.320 --> 37:14.050
speaking out of turn is a fault.

37:14.280 --> 37:17.150
Jianglai will definitely
be appointed to the capital.

37:17.150 --> 37:18.440
The one who manages his household

37:18.440 --> 37:19.840
must be a virtuous woman.

37:20.510 --> 37:21.710
As his elder sister,

37:21.710 --> 37:23.300
every word I speak is for his own good.

37:23.300 --> 37:24.360
And yet look at him—

37:25.700 --> 37:26.910
indulging a woman

37:27.510 --> 37:29.760
so domineering and arrogant.

37:30.110 --> 37:33.710
Is he not afraid of being mocked
by his superiors and colleagues?

37:40.960 --> 37:42.220
Fetch a basin of water.

37:46.880 --> 37:50.030
Good. Having a sense of shame
is a form of bravery.

37:50.440 --> 37:52.280
It's good that you know your mistake
and want to correct it.

37:52.280 --> 37:53.510
What I said just now

37:53.630 --> 37:55.480
was spoken in the heat of anger.

37:55.840 --> 37:58.320
There's no need
to scrub the seat on the spot.

38:10.920 --> 38:11.760
Lady Shanbao.

38:12.360 --> 38:13.280
What are you...

38:14.400 --> 38:15.000
Xiu Qiong.

38:30.400 --> 38:32.800
When our Founding Emperor raised his army,

38:32.980 --> 38:34.780
he had no more than 200 soldiers,

38:34.830 --> 38:36.430
and barely 40 suits of armor.

38:36.760 --> 38:39.030
The Rong family's ancestor
saw his potential,

38:39.030 --> 38:40.610
and poured out all the fortune

38:40.610 --> 38:42.880
to support His Majesty
in his most desperate days.

38:42.880 --> 38:45.060
After the Founding Emperor
ascended the throne,

38:45.060 --> 38:47.240
he granted my ancestor
the title of Marquis of Boyang,

38:47.240 --> 38:48.630
and personally bestowed

38:48.630 --> 38:50.360
the plaque of the Rong Mansion.

38:50.670 --> 38:52.400
My ancestor
declined the official position

38:52.400 --> 38:53.440
and the land.

38:54.290 --> 38:55.940
He only asked the Founding Emperor

38:55.940 --> 38:57.100
for one promise—

38:57.700 --> 38:59.880
one ratified with the imperial jade seal.

38:59.880 --> 39:01.340
And what was that promise?

39:01.920 --> 39:03.510
That the descendants of the Rong family

39:03.510 --> 39:06.110
may preserve
our ancient customs and ancestral rules,

39:06.110 --> 39:08.440
including the right
to take in husbands of our own will.

39:08.440 --> 39:11.060
This right is passed down
through every generation.

39:11.060 --> 39:12.680
Except in cases of treason or rebellion,

39:12.680 --> 39:14.390
no official may interfere with us.

39:14.390 --> 39:16.320
Anyone who dares
to harass the Rong family,

39:16.320 --> 39:18.180
or force us to change our customs,

39:19.040 --> 39:20.670
shall be executed

39:20.910 --> 39:22.710
for defying an imperial decree.

39:25.800 --> 39:28.400
Who are you trying to scare
with this nonsense?

39:29.280 --> 39:30.590
Why have I never heard of

39:30.590 --> 39:31.520
such a jade seal?

39:32.310 --> 39:34.160
My family stays in Linji

39:34.430 --> 39:36.430
and rarely sets foot in the capital.

39:36.570 --> 39:38.270
Those noble families who knew our history

39:38.270 --> 39:39.840
have probably vanished long ago.

39:39.840 --> 39:42.500
You are welcome to kneel
before the palace gates

39:42.820 --> 39:45.900
and ask if this jade seal
is real or not.

39:56.630 --> 39:58.090
Even if it's real, so what?

39:58.630 --> 40:01.230
You're not going to behead me, are you?

40:06.760 --> 40:07.510
Mother.

40:08.590 --> 40:09.440
Mother.

40:09.800 --> 40:10.480
Mother.

40:11.880 --> 40:12.590
Mother.

40:12.960 --> 40:16.360
This is a serious matter.
No one would dare forge such a thing.

40:16.390 --> 40:18.440
If it's truly
the Founding Emperor's jade seal,

40:18.440 --> 40:19.880
even the present Emperor

40:19.880 --> 40:20.940
must bow before it,

40:21.690 --> 40:23.090
let alone people like us.

40:27.550 --> 40:28.140
Madam Chang.

40:28.140 --> 40:28.750
It's fine.

41:08.770 --> 41:10.670
Madam Chang, you come
from a distinguished family.

41:10.670 --> 41:12.030
You're well-educated and wise,

41:12.030 --> 41:14.230
so you understand what is at stake here.

41:15.080 --> 41:16.680
As for Princess Jinxiang...

41:22.920 --> 41:23.720
Mother.

41:41.920 --> 41:44.110
Huiqing, help me.

41:46.710 --> 41:48.430
Princess Jinxiang
is known for her blunt speech.

41:48.430 --> 41:49.430
She meant no harm.

41:49.920 --> 41:51.840
If she had known
the Rong family abides by customs

41:51.840 --> 41:53.510
granted by the Founding Emperor,

41:53.510 --> 41:55.550
she would never have dared
to speak so offensively.

41:55.550 --> 41:57.000
For Lord Lu's sake,

41:57.310 --> 41:58.840
please be lenient with her.

41:59.060 --> 41:59.900
Fetch water.

42:01.920 --> 42:02.480
You...

42:03.760 --> 42:04.820
What are you doing?

42:07.620 --> 42:09.620
What a pity that a young lady like you

42:09.630 --> 42:11.840
would say such absurd
and backward doctrines.

42:11.840 --> 42:12.840
Words like these,

42:12.960 --> 42:14.920
coming from your lips, offended my ears.

42:14.920 --> 42:16.400
They're utterly annoying.

42:16.400 --> 42:17.590
Today I will neither scold you

42:17.590 --> 42:18.450
nor strike you.

42:18.900 --> 42:20.900
I'll simply have you wash your mouth

42:21.030 --> 42:22.310
and clear your mind.

42:22.820 --> 42:23.420
Xiu Qiong.

42:32.800 --> 42:34.260
The Founding Emperor
issued a strict decree:

42:34.260 --> 42:36.190
any man of talent or noble of merit,

42:36.800 --> 42:38.720
even a member of the imperial family,

42:38.720 --> 42:40.380
once he joins the Rong family,

42:40.380 --> 42:42.180
he must abide by our traditions.

42:42.500 --> 42:44.670
This rule does not apply
to Lu Jianglai alone.

42:44.670 --> 42:45.800
Even the Duke's family,

42:45.800 --> 42:47.200
our in-laws by marriage,

42:47.880 --> 42:49.410
must obey our rules as well.

42:53.550 --> 42:55.440
You're going too far!

42:55.440 --> 42:56.000
You...
